hadiths[13]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1949","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri aur Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Musalman ko thakaan aur na beemaari aur na gham aur na dukh aur na takleef aur na fikr pahunchti hai. Yahan tak ke kaanta jo use chubhta hai. Magar Allah uskey sath uskey gunaahon ko maaf karta hai. (Bukhari: 5642)"
"1950","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ki misaal kheti ki narm tehni jaisi hai. Jidhar se hawa aati hai use jhuka deti hai. Phir jab seedhi hoti hai to bala se jhukti hai. Aur faasiq cheed key darkht jaisa sakht seedha hai yahan tak ke Allah use todta hai jab chaahta hai. (Bukhari: 5644)"
"1951","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jiskay sath Allah bhalai chaahta hai use takleef pahunch aata hai. (Bukhari: 5645)"
"1952","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zyada kisi par dard sakht nahi dekha. (Bukhari: 5646)"
"1953","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas Aap key marz mein aaya jabke Aap ko sakht bukhaar tha. Aur main ne kaha: Beshak tumhey sakht bukhaar hai. Main ne kaha: Beshak wo isliye ke tumhaarey liye do ajr hain? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Musalman ko takleef nahi pahunchti magar Allah us se uskey gunaah jhaadta hai jaisa darkht key patte jhadtey hain. (Bukhari: 5647)"
"1954","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne apne baaz sahaaba se kaha: Kya main tumhey Jannat walon mein se aurat na dikhaaun? Main ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Unhon-ne kaha: Ye kaali aurat hai. Wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aai aur us ne kaha: Beshak mujhey mirgi aati hai aur main khul jaaten hun. To Allah se merey liye dua kijiye. Aap ne farmaya: Agar chaaaho to sabr karo aur tumhaarey liye Jannat hai. Aur agar chaaaho to main Allah se dua karun ke wo tumhey aafiyat dey. To us ne kaha: Main sabr karti hun. To us ne kaha: Beshak main khul jaaten hun. To Allah se merey liye dua kijiye ke main na khulun. To Aap ne uskey liye dua ki. (Bukhari: 5652)"
"1955","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak Allah ne farmaya: Jab main apne bandey ko uski mehboob cheezon se aazmaaun aur wo sabr karey to main use un donon key badley Jannat dunga. Aankhon ka iraada kartey huey. (Bukhari: 5653)"
"1956","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) merey paas meri ayaadat key liye aey jabke wo khachchar aur na ghodey par sawaar they. (Bukhari: 5664)"
"1957","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne kaha: Haey mera sar! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhaara dard agar hota jabke main zinda hun. To main tumhaarey liye maghfirat maangun aur tumhaarey liye dua karun. To Aisha ne kaha: Haey mera dukh! Allah ki qasam beshak main gumaan karti hun ke tum meri maut ko pasand kartey ho. Aur agar wo hota to tum apne din key aakhir mein apni baaz biwiyon key sath dulha banay rehtey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Balke mujhey, haey mera sar! Beshak main ne qasad kya tha. Ya main ne chaaha tha ke main Abu Bakr aur uskey betey ki taraf bhejun aur ahd karun ke kehney waley kahengey ya tamanna karney waley tamanna karengey. Phir main ne kaha: Allah inkaar karega aur momin rad karengey. Ya Allah rad karega aur momin inkaar karengey. (Bukhari: 5666)"
"1958","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein koi takleef key sabab jo use pahunchi maut ki tamanna na karey. Phir agar wo zaroor karney wala ho to use kehna chaahiye: Ae Allah! Mujhey zinda rakkh jab tak zindagi merey liye behtar ho. Aur mujhey faut farma jab maut merey liye behtar ho. (Bukhari: 5671)"
"1959","[AI-translation] Khabbaab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke us ne saat daagh lagwaae. To us ne kaha: Beshak hamaarey sahaaba jo guzar gaey hain guzar gaey aur duniya ne unhey kam nahi kya. Aur beshak ham ne paaya hai jiskay liye mitti key siwa jagah nahi paatey. Aur kaash Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein maut se dua maangney se mana na kya hota to main uskey sath dua maangta. (Bukhari: 5672)"
"1960","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Kisi ko uska amal Jannat mein daakhil na karega. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur tumhey bhi nahi Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, aur mujhey bhi nahi magar ye ke Allah mujhey fazl aur rehmat se dhaanp ley. To seedhey raho aur qareeb raho. Aur tum mein koi maut ki tamanna na karey. Ya nekokaar, shayed wo bhalai mein badhey. Ya gunaahgaar, shayed wo tauba karey. (Bukhari: 5673)"
"1961","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab beemaar key paas aatey ya Aap key paas laaya jaata to farmaatey: Takleef door farma, ae logon key Rab! Shifa dey, jabke tu Shaafi hai. Teri shifa key siwa shifa nahi hai. Aisi shifa jo beemaari nahi chhorti. (Bukhari: 5675). Tib ki kitaab."
